A colleague reuses depth-first search to find the fewest hops. It also visits neighbours in sorted order.

```python
def find_path(adj, s, t, seen=None):
    if seen is None:
        seen = set()
    seen.add(s)
    if s == t:
        return [s]
    for v in sorted(adj[s]):
        if v not in seen:
            p = find_path(adj, v, t, seen)
            if p:
                return [s] + p
    return None
```

